VERIFICATION_FRAMEWORK v1.0

// All mathematical operations must pass formal verification
// before being included in the reasoner

[SYMBOLIC_ALGEBRA]
- All equivalence transformations require Coq proofs
- All simplification rules must be reversible
- All operations must preserve mathematical identity

[CALCULUS]
- All integrals require convergence proofs
- All derivatives must satisfy limit definitions
- All series expansions require radius of convergence

[VALIDATION]
- All outputs must be verifiable through multiple independent methods
- All solutions must include error bounds
- All approximations must include convergence guarantees